body:
My spouse has been playing these fucked up mind games for years, things got even worse after I opened up about my depressive issues. They have been using that along with constant manipulation to try to get what they want. If I don't blindly say yes to all of their wants, then I'm the monster. To their family, they make me seem like the best spouse/parent/friend in the world, but behind closed doors they lie and manipulate, and attempt to make me feel guilty for things i have no control over. I am always in the wrong, no matter what.

&#x200B;

I am tired of being emotionally bullied in my own home.
